   "id": "doc-1k0pdi6ff3",
   "content": {
    "text": "<em>Listen and subscribe to the podcast «NZZ Machtspiel» on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/2wGoVfkuFOCoMwhXbYkNUk\">Spotify</a>, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/at/podcast/nzz-machtspiel/id1794207136\">Apple Podcasts</a> or <a href=\"https://castbox.fm/channel/NZZ-Machtspiel-id6457489?country=de\">Castbox</a>.</em>"
